Spec: Owned headless Android emulator lifetime

Purpose:
  Bound native test runtime and terminate the emulator and isolated ADB server when their owner exits.

Owns:
  ./EmulatorHarness.csproj
  ./Program.cs

References:
  /windows/LinkGate.Processes/LinkGate.Processes.sdd

Must:
  Hold verified executable files and kernel Jobs before resuming child processes.
  Refuse occupied fixture ports and never stop the default ADB server or unrelated emulator.
  Require an explicit stop marker or exit within thirty minutes; keep logs in private artifact directories.
